{"id": "DdGuPVBvXKs", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"ASTRA\" to build full 3d AD campaigns with GPT-6 Astra and Higgsfield. \n\nGPT-6 Astra can now design full, end-to-end 3D ad campaigns on its own.\n\nAnd they're actually good.\n\nHere's how it works.\n\nYou just feed in an input.\n\nA product image, a 2D sketch, a Zillow photo, whatever you want.\n\nAstra takes it and reproduces it inside Blender.\n\nThen you connect it to Higgsfield.\n\nYou feed in a render.\n\nAnd give it access to Genjutsu to generate thousands of different styles.\n\nIt split tests them to find the perfect creative.\n\nNow it designs the shots and generates them too.\n\nYou put one product photo in.\n\nAnd you get a whole campaign out.\n\nThink of it like handing one photo to an entire creative agency, and getting back a finished ad set.\n\nNo briefs, no back and forth, no waiting days for revisions.\n\nThe whole pipeline runs start to finish without you touching a single tool manually.\n\nThat's the part that actually changes how fast you can move.\n\n#Higgsfield #Ai3d #chatgptastra #Aiads #HiggsfieldGenjutsu", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789039525, "like_count": 1353, "comment_count": 955, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-915702441568198a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.393, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMHhXIFIX36HAzTX5kkOrZC6am6UpSsLG8vdPUTu7w5Wuy4llhh_-PQE70Cr6hjJNG1cNcpeFMjfiZqmNtLwe_X-oLiqQuX6Sud1s8.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdpNCMPtRmYjWsBMixXG6fxkkKb7fTGPJC4IjbVgR6PzVkkh6yr3OxIdYHXU8TiKs7I&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=RDJDgss3QEYQ7kNvwFI9kXN&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=46pTV8wkD8KO7Suyre4jCA&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTxxsdALQUYixQX747xz2_XySYtjfE